    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i was just born to repeat everything they did. my dad, his dad... it's like there's this rot in our bloodline. no matter how hard i try to be different, i just end up back in the same dark places. i feel like i’m just a placeholder for more misery.",
